OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with patchy rain
OL,6,Fincreasingly reaching from the west,
OL,7,Fthough little is expected to penetrate
OL,8,Fas far as the east coast. Winds
OL,9,Fincreasing to a fresh to strong
OL,10,Fsoutherly come late afternoon across
OL,11,Fthe east coasts, pegging back
OL,12,Ftemperature here.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain for the evening, turning
OL,15,Fmore persistent late evening, then
OL,16,Fclearing towards dawn, to leave only a
OL,17,Ffew light showers in the west. Brisk
OL,18,Fsoutherly winds easing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
