OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA cloudy start in the east.
OL,6,FOtherwise a day of showers mixed with
OL,7,Fbrighter spells, with the bulk of the
OL,8,Fshowers confined west of a line from
OL,9,FBuckie to Ballater.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday brings brighter spells and
OL,13,Fscattered showers. Sunday sees showers
OL,14,For longer periods of rain and brisk
OL,15,Fsouth to southwest winds. Monday
OL,16,Fmainly dry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
